    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MSA201 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MSA201 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Vehicle Dynamics Modeling and Simulation</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Dieter Schramm, Manfred Hiller, Roberto Bardini · Springer · 2018 · 2nd · ISBN <code>978-3662571989</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Vehicle Dynamics Theory and Application Third Edition</strong></p><p>Reza N. Jazar · Springer · 2017 · 3rd · ISBN <code>978-3319851556</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Modeling and Simulation with Simulink</strong></p><p>Ali Nejad, Sam Turton, Pranav Mohan · Coursera · N/A · ISBN <code>N/A</code></p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/modeling-with-simulink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/modeling-with-simulink</a></p></div>"
